<title>SINGAPORE: FCC to buy Singapore site for S$139 mln.</title>
<headline>FCC to buy Singapore site for S$139 mln.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1996-11-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>First Capital Corp said on Thursday it would buy a block of residential properties in Singapore for a total of Singapore $139 million.  </p>
<p>The company said in a statement that the purchase of the 7,453.7 sq metre site, close to the city-state's Orchard Road shopping area, would be financed from internal resources and bank borrowings.</p>
<p>-- Singapore newsroom (65 8703199)</p>
